
[P_07_UNhq_BloodMessage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Dammit! Someone arrived before us. It must be Kim.  Stop him at any cost.
[P_07_UNhq_Cameranetmessage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - That's weird! Security cameras are off. Proceed to the security control room floor.
[P_07_UNhq_DefeatKim]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Got him! Kim won't be a threat any longer. Good job.
[P_07_UNhq_EleserviceMessage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - I remind you that killing UN guards or civilians is not allowed. Moreover, if the general alarm sounds you will no longer be able to reach the bomb. Be invisible and silent like only a Splinter Cell can.
[P_07_UNhq_ElevatorMessage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - The security control room is on the other side of the floor. Once you get out of the elevator, follow the main corridor and you ll find it.
[P_07_UNhq_InterogateKim]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=(null)
[P_07_UNhq_Missioncompleted]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - At last, this threat is over. Good job Splinter Cells.
[P_07_UNhq_NOalarm]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - God Dammit! They called a general alarm. The mission is over.
[P_07_UNhq_NOkill]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Sweet Jesus! what did you do ? The mission is aborted
