[P_07_UNhq_Objectives]
Note_0026L=Lethal force on UN guards and civilians is not allowed
Note_0027L=The mission will be aborted if a general alarm is called
Note_0028L=Emergency doors can only be opened from the inside
Note_0029L=The Security Control Room is on the 22nd floor
Note_0034L=The ventilation system is on top of the General Assembly Hall
Note_0035L=The General Assembly Hall is in the second building
Note_0036L=The ground floor can be reached with a service elevator
Objective_0007=Infiltrate the building
Objective_0008=The service stairs lead to the top floor, but the emergency doors can only be opened from the inside. Find another way to get into the building.
Objective_0012=Reach the Security Control Room
Objective_0013=Security cameras are off. Use the elevator to reach the Security Control Room.
Objective_0016=Stop Colonel Kim
Objective_0017=Colonel Kim has taken control of the Security Control Room.
Objective_0024=Recover the encrypted data sent by Jin Soo
Objective_0025=Third Echelon intercepted an encrypted communication between Jin Soo and the UN Headquarters. Recover any data sent by Jin Soo.
Objective_0032=Defuse the bomb before it blows
Objective_0033=Kim placed a bomb in the General Assembly Hall ventilation system. Defuse it before the countdown is over.
POPUPMESSAGE_0040=Reach the Security Control Room
POPUPMESSAGE_0041=Stop Colonel Kim
POPUPMESSAGE_0042=Defuse the bomb before it blows
POPUPMESSAGE_0043=Infiltrate the building
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=LAMBERT - Here we are. Be ready for hostilities.
Speech_0037L=LAMBERT - My God! Kim placed a bomb before we arrived. It's in the General Assembly Hall ventilation system. An important meeting is taking place there. Hurry! You must defuse the bomb before it blows.
[P_07_UNhq_paralleltimer]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Time is running out! Only 5 minutes left. Hurry up!
Speech_0002L=LAMBERT - Time is almost up. In 60 seconds it will be too late. Come on!
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT - We have only 10 minutes before it blows.
Speech_0006L=LAMBERT - Bad news. We have only 20 minutes before it blows.
[P_07_UNhq_Startingmessage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Welcome to the UN. Remember that lethal force is not allowed and I'll abort the mission if a general alarm sounds. Now, rappel down to the window washing platform and get into the building.
[P_07_UNhq_Ventilationroomsg]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Well done. That's half of the job. Now you have to reach the other side of the room. There's a passage but you must go back downstairs to find it.
[P_07_UNhq_BaseAlert]
POPUPMESSAGE_0002=Alarm Stage One
POPUPMESSAGE_0003=Alarm Stage Two
POPUPMESSAGE_0004=Alarm Stage Three
POPUPMESSAGE_0005=Alarm Stage Four - Full Alert
